OL,3,GNEWSAFarm GPS thefts could cost
OL,4,A'hundreds of thousands'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer has warned GPS thefts could
OL,7,Flead to losses of hundreds of thousands
OL,8,Fof pounds after reports of farms being
OL,9,Ftargeted across Kent this summer.
OL,11,FAlan Clifton-Holt, a National Farmers'
OL,12,FUnion representative, says the
OL,13,Fspecialist equipment can cost about
OL,14,F#10,000, with some vehicles unable to
OL,15,Foperate without the it.
OL,17,FKent Police said farms in Canterbury,
OL,18,FFolkestone, Romney Marsh, Maidstone,
OL,19,FSheppey and Thanet reported incidents
OL,20,Finvolving people targeting agricultural
OL,21,FGPS systems in July and August.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
