OL,3,GNEWSAFarm GPS thefts could cost
OL,4,A'hundreds of thousands'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said tackling rural crime
OL,7,Fremained a year-round priority, despite
OL,8,Fsome offences increasing in autumn as
OL,9,Fevenings grew darker and more farming
OL,10,Fequipment was used.
